  "note": "Kit 6 (2026-10-17): a stone-and-iron theme for strategy games, city builders and kingdom sims. Grey ashlar frames over dark oak-brown panels; the heavy frames (window, dialogue box, portrait frame, the MZ window) are castle walls seen from the side: a corbelled turret with three merlons and an arrow slit rises above each top corner and each bottom corner stands on a battered footing (geometry.corner \"tower\"). A heraldic blue banner accent with white ink for the main actions, a crimson danger family. Every text-on-fill pair is re-measured by the gate.",
